{"symbol":"KMP.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:52:40Z","info":{"address1":"56 Parkowa Street","city":"Laskowice","zip":"86-130","country":"Poland","phone":"48 525 10 88 00","fax":"48 552 79 19 78","website":"https://kompap.pl","industry":"Paper & Paper Products","industryKey":"paper-paper-products","industryDisp":"Paper & Paper Products","sector":"Basic Materials","sectorKey":"basic-materials","sectorDisp":"Basic Materials","longBusinessSummary":"Przedsiebiorstwo Produkcyjno - Handlowe KOMPAP S.A. manufactures and sells paper and printing products and services in Poland and internationally. The company prints leaflets, brochures, and user manuals and training materials for pharmaceutical, cosmetic, technical, and educational industry; A4 letterhead, for laser printers used in office, business correspondence, invoices, and official documents; and commercial prints, such as accounting, HR, warehouse, and sales prints. It also prints self-adhesive labels in the form of sheets, rolls, and folds for offices, warehouses, and other industries; and graphic design studio provides design and preparation of materials for printing, offering computer-to-plate printing plates. In addition, the company offers printing books, albums and school textbooks; printing services, including the production of books, magazines, commercial prints, and calendars; and offers solutions that enable secure and effective management of information in the form of documents. It serves its products under the BZGraf, OZGraf, and Komunikacja Masowa brand name. Przedsiebiorstwo Produkcyjno - Handlowe KOMPAP S.A. was founded in 1989 and is headquartered in Laskowice, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":337,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Waldemar  Lipka","title":"President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":675000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dorota  Dabrowska","title":"Chief Accountant","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedVal